--- !u!114 &176452906
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 176452904}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 411e218e5a0c97e4f849660e5457bc2b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractable
  Title: Maintenance Log
  Body: 'Generator 2 is holding. Generator 3 keeps tripping at night

    and I cannot
    find the fault.


    For whoever is on nights: stay under the working lamps
    when

    you can. You will feel the difference. The dark places take

    something
    out of you and they give it back slowly.


    Spare batteries are in the huts
    along the west track and in

    the store rooms. Take every one you find. You
    will want them

    before the night is over.


    The big house is further
    up the road, on the left. Its door

    is locked. Reception held that key, and
    Reception is the low

    building on the east side.'
  ReadSound: {fileID: 0}
  SanityOnFirstRead: 0
  DisappearAfterReading: 0
