--- !u!114 &185222908
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 185222906}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 411e218e5a0c97e4f849660e5457bc2b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractable
  Title: A Note to Himself
  Body: 'If you are reading this in your own handwriting and do not

    remember
    writing it, stop. Sit down. Do not go to the east

    wing to check.


    You
    have checked. That is why this note exists.


    The room key is here with me.
    It opens two doors and only

    one of them matters. The one in the big house
    is where they

    filed us. The one in the far house, north past the cabins,

    upper
    floor, is where they kept the file that was never

    closed.


    Go north.
    Do not waste the night on the big house.'
  ReadSound: {fileID: 0}
  SanityOnFirstRead: -8
  DisappearAfterReading: 0
