  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractable
  Title: The Last One
  Body: 'You have been very thorough.


    We appreciate that. Most of them stop
    at four or five and

    decide the building is just old.


    Go through the
    door. We will do the intake again.

    It goes faster each time.'
