  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractable
  Title: Discharge Papers
  Body: 'Patient discharged. No transport arranged.

    No next of kin contacted.

    No
    name recorded, as the patient continued to insist he

    worked here.


    Attending
    physician: -- (signature illegible)


    Filed by: the patient.


    There
    is nothing else in this room. The one you want is

    north, at the top of the
    far house, and it has been waiting

    longer than you have.'
  ReadSound: {fileID: 0}
  SanityOnFirstRead: -12
  DisappearAfterReading: 0
