--- !u!114 &2106447148
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2106447146}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 411e218e5a0c97e4f849660e5457bc2b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteInteractable
  Title: Letter, Unsent
  Body: 'Mara,


    They have me on the new dose. I am sleeping, which is

    something,
    but I dream about the hallway with the mirrors

    and I wake up already walking.


    Dr.
    Halloway says the echoes are just memory folding over

    itself. He says it
    kindly. He says it every week. He has

    said it in exactly the same words
    every week.


    I am starting to think he is not saying it to me.


    I took
    the house key off the hook here. If you are reading

    this then I never used
    it. Go west across the road. The

    cabin key is upstairs in the big house,
    in the room over

    the front door.'
  ReadSound: {fileID: 0}
  SanityOnFirstRead: -5
  DisappearAfterReading: 0
